        {
          "text": "Six months of monthly reports. Six months from when? It doesn't say.",
          "src": "audio/fix_story-1.wav",
          "startFrame": 121,
          "durationFrames": 248
        },
        {
          "text": "RegOS reads it, gets the same answer twice over, and stops there. Fifty percent, and a case for a person.",
          "src": "audio/fix_story-2.wav",
          "startFrame": 388,
          "durationFrames": 393
        },
        {
          "text": "Now the same clause with the start date written in. That edit is ours, not SEBI's, and the page says so.",
          "src": "audio/fix_story-3.wav",
          "startFrame": 799,
          "durationFrames": 376
        },
        {
          "text": "A hundred percent. Nothing to raise.",
          "src": "audio/fix_story-4.wav",
          "startFrame": 1193,
          "durationFrames": 132
        },
        {
          "text": "It isn't hunting for something to flag. It's looking for one thing, and that thing is gone.",
